Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much further.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有人可以帮她包扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have people who can patch her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:33.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,标记回去的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm marking our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你左边  -我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On your left!  - I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-丹尼尔  -克尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daniel. - Colton.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直在找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:23.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们自己也找到了一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like you found some people yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我睡了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I been asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:04:59.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生说你在好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor says you're healing up --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说情况本可能更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}said it could have been much worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you had some luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上带着武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your pack with the weapons --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:11.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想把武器锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wanted to lock them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然他们在帮我们  我就没反驳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing as they were helping us, I didn't argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走之前  武器都要交给他们保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be with them until we're ready to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:21.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想那得还要一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure that'll be another week,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:22.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许时间更长\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe a little more,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就能动身回亚历山大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we can start back to Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是什么地方  -这里的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this place? - Well, the people here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,称这个地方为"神之国"\N{\fnArial\fs30}they, um, they call this place "The Kingdom."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were helping you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:50.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我在帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I've been helping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:06:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他们说了我的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you -- Did you tell them about what happened to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我们的身份吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我们是谁  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Who are we, Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跟他们说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看见了那男人对你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw what that man did to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也看见了我对他做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they saw what I did to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你惹上了麻烦  我找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found trouble. I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要带你去见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man I'm taking you to see --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.33,0:06:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the person who's in charge of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:23.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这人有名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This person have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-摩根  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morgan? ?- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:30.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫"以西结国王"\N{\fnArial\fs30}...he's called "King Ezekiel."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有自己的一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}he does his own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:49.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘记说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, I forgot to say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:16.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结有只老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel has a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:08:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希瓦  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiva, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位淑女经历了诸多磨难\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fair maiden has been through a myriad of trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我们的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点  希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill it up, "S."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:18.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞  你是个忠诚的管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry, you are a faithful steward,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你的话让我很困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your words leave me pitch-kettled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解你的担心  希瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your concern, Shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:31.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有见过卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't met Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但既然她是摩根的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she is a friend of Morgan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该把她视为神之国的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall consider her a friend of the realm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非有相反证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}until proven otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她好转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's doing better,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了你和你的人  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to you and your people, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见你能起床走动  我很高兴  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pleases me to see you up and about, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是以西结国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am King Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:11.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国王与你说话  你却一言不发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been addressed by the king, yet you remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你心存疑虑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I detect skepticism?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你以为我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you think me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你以为这个地方不过是镜花水月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you see this place as nothing more than a mirage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:24.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:28.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么看待神之国的  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think of The Kingdom, Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是怎么看待本王的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:41.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...觉得您棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...think you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有您的希巴...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your Sheba --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫"希瓦"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, "Shiva."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:56.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差点惊得说不出话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be speechless if I wasn't already speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我的喜大于惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the most wonderful way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如同摩根所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Morgan is aware,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.19,0:10:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我鼓励那些在此修养的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I encourage those who find respite here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时享用我们这伟大的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to enjoy the fruits of our grandeur for as long as they like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他们有所贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}so long as they contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.31,0:10:15.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取水于井  还井以水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink from the well, replenish the well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:17.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  等你好了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you've healed, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  井养最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. All about the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得井辟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well-said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的待客之道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.47,0:10:31.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请尽情吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, partake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有美味的苹果  油桃  石榴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have magnificent apples, nectarines, pomegranates --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是在神之国里种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all grown right here inside the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该吃水果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fruit time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少吃个石榴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least take a pomegranate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:50.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总是觉得吃这个太麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I always found them too much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苦皮包甜果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet fruit surrounded by bitter --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是挺矛盾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're something of a contradiction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这也是天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but heaven for the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放些巧克力在我面前  我马上就能吃光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You park some chocolate in front of me and watch it go bye-bye,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:02.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是石榴...我真不太喜欢  谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but pomegranates -- just not for me, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你有什么需要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if there's anything you want or need --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你喜欢音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you enjoy music,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一位吉他手  他的演奏催人泪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a guitarist whose talent brings tears to the eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有个小合唱团\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have a small choir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一需要的就是多休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need is some more rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还需要一把梳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe a hairbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人告诉我要觐见王室\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one told me I'd be meeting royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总而言之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, Your Majesty --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:31.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是应该称您为"陛下"吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should call you "Your Majesty," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以这么称呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我深感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很荣幸  卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pleasure is mine, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:11:59.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在逗我是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're shitting me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这...很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's -- it's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It -- It --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:07.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. Stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方跟个马戏团似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a damn circus --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人...活在童话中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-These people -- this is make-believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:14.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像在玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's playtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:16.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不来  我不能待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this. I can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  卡萝尔  这些人找到了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Carol, these people found --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我待不下去  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:23.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会待下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:24.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会等待时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到你不在身边  没法阻止我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're not there to stop me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到没人能阻止我了  我就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}when nobody else is, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:30.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不能让你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.67,0:12:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'll --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像那个狼一样把我绑起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie me up like that wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这由不得你来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前在地下室里不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't before in the basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在图书馆时不是  现在也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wasn't at the library, and it isn't now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a shit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:49.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是否自认为找到了生命的奥秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you think you've found the secret to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我... -不  我没有这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I -- ?- No, I don't. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  我也没找到  我知道我引发了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't, and I haven't. And I know what I've started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会让你死在外面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I won't let you die out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我不会做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-打猎  -猎捕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hunting. - Hunting what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经被关在农场的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was once captive to the farm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在在城里自由奔驰\N{\fnArial\fs30}now runs free in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:50.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}?Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  快点  跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快跑  -快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on!  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转弯  转弯  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn! Turn! Whoo, whoo! ?Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now! Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走  快走  -快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go now! Go now! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now! Go now! Go! ?Come on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好样的  理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well-done, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just what we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:18.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要用行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在赶它们进去  你为什么还需要诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're herding them in. Why do you need bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我希望它们的肚子里装满腐肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I want their bellies full of rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:27.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在深山老林里开机枪  不会招来任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot a machine gun in the woods, and nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果在城里咳一声  就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cough in the city, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:44.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黛安  去把货车开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diane, retrieve the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.07,0:14:56.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该你上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:14:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用砍刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the machete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:02.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你和他练习时那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as you and he have practiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像我们练习时那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we practiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要觉得不安  本杰明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not be troubled, Benjamin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:42.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要让家里的人知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one back home needs to know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:45.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说这些猪吃腐尸的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the pigs -- that they're eating the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何事都别提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿我们有一天能解除你们所有人的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we one day cease you all from this curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前  要知道我们生活在你们的土地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till then, know that we live on in your place...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:14.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充实  忠诚  自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}full, festive, faithful, and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能算半自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only halfway free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你使用棍杖的技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your skill with the staff...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.99,0:17:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么掌握这种技能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did you come to acquire that skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个做奶酪的朋友教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a cheesemaker, a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信如今你的同伴一定非常以你为傲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine your comrade would be very proud of you this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一击就救了本的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}For saving Ben in a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这么一种说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a saying --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悲观主义者向下看  磕到了脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pessimist looks down and hits his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乐观主义者向上看\N{\fnArial\fs30}The optimist looks up...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去了立足点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and loses his footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.11,0:17:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实主义者向前看\N{\fnArial\fs30}The realist looks forward
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据前方的情况调整自己的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}and adjusts his path accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得小本杰明的路线  就需要调整\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe young Benjamin's path is in need of adjustment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能训练他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you train him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你的朋友训练你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your friend trained you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我是否是适合...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that I'm the --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.55,0:18:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本杰明在刀枪上没有造诣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin has shown aptitude with neither blades nor munitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他失败的原因在于武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps his failings lie in the weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许在于师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps it's the teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许两者都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and perhaps it's both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开枪才救下了卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man I shot to save Carol,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棍杖救不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}the stick couldn't have saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:29.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棍杖救过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it saved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小本杰明要成为我这里的重要一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Benjamin will become an important member of my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.57,0:18:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要那孩子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the boy to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要他活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need him to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神之国再次为你的到来而高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Kingdom is favored by your presence once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(取水于井  还井以水)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才太快了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was too fast, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  我能跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I can keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-打头  -打头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over the head? - Over the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. And again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向后抡  上举\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing it back and up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,口味层层叠加\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was flavor on top of flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:17.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直太梦幻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like a goddamn dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:21.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早餐吃酥皮水果馅饼  真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, breakfast cobbler? That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.87,0:21:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前可是靠吃负鼠充饥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were eating possum out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更喜欢午餐吃酥皮水果馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I like the lunch cobbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:30.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午餐还有酥皮水果馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's lunch cobbler?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们每顿都有酥皮水果馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have cobbler at every meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:47.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能...天啊  老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...I can't. Oh, God! Oh, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有纸巾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any tissues?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.35,0:22:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是...哲学书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh...It's philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们真的得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we should really get back to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.43,0:22:28.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-继续练习了  -借我看看行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what we were doing. - You mind if I borrow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.68,0:22:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里所有的书我都读过了  两遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just read every book in this place...twice...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:37.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包括空调维修说明书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including an air-conditioning repair textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.93,0:22:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  供热通风与空气调节系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, the number-one problem
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.91,0:22:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最大的问题其实不是致冷剂泄漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an H.V.A.C. system isn't refrigerant leaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.72,0:22:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不给你剧透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't spoil that one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:22:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.80,0:23:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们来  你们俩都来\N{\fnArial\fs30}come with us, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.31,0:23:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很重要的事要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have matters of import to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你枪带上  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your gun, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猪是在离神之国很远的地方被屠宰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The swine are slaughtered far from The Kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.72,0:23:27.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以免他们的叫声招致麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}lest their screams carry in the wind and invite questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:30.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里做的事对我的人保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we are doing here is a secret I keep from my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.90,0:23:34.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人把秘密当作是统治的特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some see secrets as a privilege of ruling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.94,0:23:39.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是障碍  不是奖赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are burdens, not part of the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.71,0:23:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还担心我们来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I was worried we were early.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.98,0:24:10.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对我们的协议非常认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our arrangement is something I consider with the utmost seriousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.36,0:24:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一次都会准时履行义务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will fulfill our obligations on time, every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.98,0:24:18.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实如此  你以后也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, indeedy, you do, and you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一二三四五六七八  一共八只  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8. I count 8 -- that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:32.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们比上次更肥大  这也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look bigger than last time. That's good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.80,0:24:34.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们吃得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were well-fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.63,0:24:35.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲自确认的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.89,0:24:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你们款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appreciate your hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.68,0:24:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的是  我们开了两辆卡车来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for us, we brought two trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.70,0:24:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你们来帮忙装货如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you, uh, help us load 'em up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.27,0:24:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是另一伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're part of another group.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.66,0:24:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们自称...  -我知道他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They call themselves  - I know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.66,0:25:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋  笑一个不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, asshole, how about a smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.65,0:25:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.71,0:25:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是便宜你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been letting you off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.15,0:25:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你没搞反吗  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you don't have that backwards, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.53,0:25:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.72,0:25:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.24,0:25:42.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.91,0:25:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把武器放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.81,0:25:58.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:06.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我们的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.73,0:26:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自由罚拳吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.57,0:26:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I love this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加文  让你的人住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin, tell your man to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.21,0:26:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-加文  -他说住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}?- Gavin! - Hey! Hey! The man said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.01,0:26:27.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对我们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's been good to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.78,0:26:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经浪费他足够多时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've taken up more than enough of his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.29,0:26:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德  我们会讨论这事  起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard, we will discuss this. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.51,0:26:55.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下周同样的时间  以西结  可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same time next week, Ezekiel, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是生产周  那就生产起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's produce week, so...produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:27:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有单子  一点不能少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the list -- not one bit less.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则  你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise...you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.07,0:27:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一个拿他开刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna have to go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.29,0:27:23.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前遇到过他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've encountered them before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.05,0:27:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一伙人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their group?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.14,0:27:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:31.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为了救卡萝尔杀的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man you killed to save Carol --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.09,0:27:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是他们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was one of them, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.28,0:27:36.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.29,0:27:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你要我来的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you wanted me here --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.07,0:27:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果有必要我可以再做一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I could do it again if I had to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.44,0:27:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.97,0:27:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实恰好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the opposite, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:12.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Whoa, whoa, whoa. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.79,0:28:14.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.66,0:28:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是电影之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's movie night tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.18,0:28:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想占个好座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to get a good seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.86,0:28:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  但你先得把东西吃干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but you were gonna clean your plate, though, first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.89,0:28:23.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  说好的  达奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. That was the deal, Dutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. ?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:30.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Good one, smart guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.12,0:28:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  十点前上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, just be in bed by 10:00 --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一分钟不许迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a minute later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.70,0:28:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can read?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.47,0:28:36.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你可以看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.43,0:28:38.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.29,0:28:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.11,0:28:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.70,0:28:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对如何抚养他一知半解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only kind of know what I'm doing raising him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结帮了很大的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel's been a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:28:58.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem close...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.92,0:29:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关系好像很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.16,0:29:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他曾经和我爸爸关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was, uh, pretty tight with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.54,0:29:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲曾经是一名优秀的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was a good fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.78,0:29:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神之国最好的战士之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the best in The Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.80,0:29:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.85,0:29:17.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概一年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:21.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结派他的小队去扫清一幢大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel sent his detachment out to clear out a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.58,0:29:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸太多  增援不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was too many wasted and not enough backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.40,0:29:31.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有八个人死在了里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight men didn't make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.81,0:29:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中就有我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was one of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.86,0:29:40.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是以西结...他现在谨慎多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But E-Ezekiel -- he's a lot more careful now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.44,0:29:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他告诉我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me that it, uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.74,0:29:50.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他告诉我他暗中和那个团队达成协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, uh, told me he was keeping his deal with that group quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.69,0:29:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他觉得人们会想要反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he thinks the people would want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.97,0:29:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说就算我们反抗  也不会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says that even if we did, we wouldn't win --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.68,0:30:00.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少不可能不死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least, not without losing people...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.48,0:30:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许会损失很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe a lot of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.91,0:30:04.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think he's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.32,0:30:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we shouldn't fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的太少  不知道应该怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I know enough to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.30,0:30:16.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.98,0:30:23.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那本书里有一段题词\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an inscription in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.04,0:30:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是手写的  是说不杀戮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was handwritten -- about not killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.17,0:30:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是你写的吗  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it yours? - It's not, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我还注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I also noticed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.72,0:30:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你晚餐只吃蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}you only put vegetables on your plate during dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.13,0:30:37.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你还教我合气道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I mean, you're teaching me aikido,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.08,0:30:38.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果合气道的意义是不杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if aikido means not to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.87,0:30:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那也就是说你...  -跟我怎么想的无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}- then that means that you're... - It's not about what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.70,0:30:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}People can --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.27,0:30:46.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们能努力让你走上正道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can try and set you in the right direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.02,0:30:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们没法教你该走那条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they can't show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.36,0:30:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得自己去寻找...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you got to find that for yourself, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.81,0:30:56.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾以为我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.24,0:30:58.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.18,0:31:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我  我还在摸索\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm -- I'm just fumbling through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.00,0:31:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时我们会改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, we change our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.62,0:31:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚想看电影吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, do you want to catch movie night?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.93,0:31:19.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.17,0:31:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.46,0:31:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得找卡萝尔谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to talk to Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.99,0:31:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.18,0:32:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你所愿  淑女\N{\fnArial\fs30}By all means, fair maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.58,0:32:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摘一个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.11,0:32:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个院子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This enclosure was built
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本是为了娱乐和学习所建造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the purpose of common recreation and study.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.53,0:32:43.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我改造成了一个花园  甚为辉煌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it repurposed into a garden worthy of our splendor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.78,0:32:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说这是我在整个神之国中最喜欢的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dare say it's my favorite place in the entire Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.44,0:32:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你决定突然离开我们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pleases me that you've seen it with your own eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.77,0:32:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能亲眼看看这里  我真的很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}before...choosing to leave us so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez, yeah, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.38,0:33:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm real sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.70,0:33:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:06.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.77,0:33:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞  能让我们单独聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry... would you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.10,0:33:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果您需要我  就叫一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need me, holler.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.15,0:33:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我随叫随到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep in hollering range.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.22,0:33:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deuces!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.60,0:33:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我现在没有碰巧遇见你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't happened upon you right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.88,0:33:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那句话怎么说的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.74,0:33:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要骗一个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never bullshit a bullshitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.46,0:33:41.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没说错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I got that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.56,0:33:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你装出温柔无辜的样子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sweet-and-innocent act you've been doing --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.65,0:33:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's quite clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.41,0:33:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.70,0:33:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你混进来  赢得别人的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blend in, get people to trust you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.65,0:33:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}acquire what you need from them,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.19,0:33:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就消失了  就像从没来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you're gone, as if you were never there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.89,0:34:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带到这里的那些枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guns you brought here in your pack
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.67,0:34:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是救世军的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they belong to Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.31,0:34:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对救世军知道多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about the Saviors?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.60,0:34:12.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸  比我在乎的还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than I care to, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.56,0:34:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们差点杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They nearly extinguished you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.45,0:34:19.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不单奋起反抗了  卡萝尔  你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did more than put up a fight, Carol -- you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.59,0:34:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来到这里就算赢了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By ending up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.06,0:34:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这很搞笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.82,0:34:35.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个笑话  这个地方也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a joke. This place is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.97,0:34:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对待笑话就得一笑而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you do with jokes -- you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.17,0:34:41.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面  外面的世界才是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there -- Out there, it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.79,0:34:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到过一些地方  让我以为我可以无需...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been to places where I thought I wouldn't have to --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.05,0:34:46.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以安心过生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I could just be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.43,0:34:50.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在用童话骗这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're selling these people a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.85,0:34:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们就需要童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they need the fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.31,0:34:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许就是需要否认现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the contradiction is the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.45,0:34:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,统治他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ruling over people
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.05,0:35:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人对你溜须拍马只是额外的好处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and having your ass kissed by everyone's just a perk?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.47,0:35:09.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能坐这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.85,0:35:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们需要可以追随的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People want someone to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.48,0:35:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是人的天性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's human nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.82,0:35:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要能让自己觉得安全的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want someone to make 'em feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.03,0:35:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有安全感的人也就没那么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And people who feel safe are less dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.83,0:35:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更有生产力\N{\fnArial\fs30}more productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.48,0:35:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看到了个养老虎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see a dude with a tiger, shoot --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.60,0:35:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就开始疯传他在野外找到老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}they start tellin' stories about finding it in the wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.39,0:35:57.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一番搏斗后驯服成他的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrestling it into submission, turning it into his pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.13,0:36:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把这人变成了一个传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make the guy larger than life,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.26,0:36:04.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.73,0:36:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能击碎他们的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who am I to burst their bubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.28,0:36:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来  他们就视我为王室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing you know, they treat me like royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.15,0:36:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要  也需要一个人去追随\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted --They needed someone to follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.94,0:36:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就配合演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}s-so I-I acted the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.25,0:36:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装模作样直到真成了那么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I faked it till I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.54,0:36:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前是个动物园管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a zookeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.51,0:36:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希瓦  她掉进了她展区的防护河里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiva -- she fell into one of the concrete moats in her exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.58,0:36:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面没水  兽医在来的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was empty, the vets were on their way,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.26,0:36:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她的腿被撕开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but her leg was ripped open.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.49,0:36:48.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会失血过多而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was gonna bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.39,0:36:51.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时她发出的叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sound she made...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.19,0:36:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她痛得不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.02,0:37:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.19,0:37:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我得试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.90,0:37:08.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把我衣服绑在她腿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got my shirt up around her leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.21,0:37:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救了她一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}saved her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.74,0:37:15.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那之后  她见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, she never showed
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.93,0:37:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连牙都不会呲\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much as a tooth in my direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.22,0:37:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,养老虎确实不现实  这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping a tiger isn't practical -- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.61,0:37:27.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有十人份的食量\N{\fnArial\fs30}She eats as much as 10 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.49,0:37:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她能把我手中的铁链拽掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could yank the chain out of my hand --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.15,0:37:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天  她甚至能把我胳膊拽下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}hell, she could yank my arm right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.97,0:37:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她没有这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.91,0:37:39.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后也不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.96,0:37:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟其他人一样  都失去了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost a lot, just like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.13,0:37:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当一切开始分崩离析时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it all started to end,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.43,0:37:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回到了动物园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found myself back at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.70,0:37:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希瓦是仅剩的几只动物之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiva was one of the last animals left.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.62,0:37:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was trapped...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.28,0:38:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥肠辘辘  孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}hungry, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.56,0:38:06.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.06,0:38:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是这个世界上我仅存的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the last thing left in this world that I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.86,0:38:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她保护了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.17,0:38:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她带我来的这  让我成为传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got me here, made me larger than life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我建了这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I made this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.53,0:38:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前在社区剧院表演过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to act in community theater --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.82,0:38:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,演过几个国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}played a few kings in my day...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.22,0:38:35.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟王  麦克白\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Arthur, Macbeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.27,0:38:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有马丁·路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.73,0:38:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我真名就叫以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name really is Ezekiel, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.88,0:38:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 100% real.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.20,0:38:55.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把话摊开说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cards on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.70,0:38:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没藏着掖着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.34,0:39:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还是希望你不要透露给他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd appreciate you keep this between us, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.89,0:39:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.48,0:39:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有点算是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yeah, a little bit for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.97,0:39:15.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.28,0:39:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想做什么随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.61,0:39:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.88,0:39:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.34,0:39:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.24,0:39:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.65,0:39:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.24,0:39:44.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你所经历过的所有苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whatever bad you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.79,0:39:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在外面的苦难很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so much of it out there now, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.73,0:39:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.51,0:40:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面好像只剩下坏事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there, it feels like it's all bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.79,0:40:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是当你孤身一人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially when you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.68,0:40:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.22,0:40:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不全是坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it's not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.88,0:40:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能是  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be. It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.33,0:40:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生命并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.69,0:40:23.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有生命的地方  就有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there's life, there's hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.62,0:40:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有英雄气概  慈悲和爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}heroism, grace, and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.93,0:40:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有生命的地方  就有生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there's life, there's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.66,0:40:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望这不是你想逃离的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that's not what you're walking away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.47,0:40:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.29,0:40:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你不用这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.24,0:40:43.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里创造了自己的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my own world here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.14,0:40:45.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了应对困境的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a way to deal with the bad
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.85,0:40:47.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是对美好的事物过分投入一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}by going a little overboard with all the good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.93,0:40:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.59,0:40:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥抱矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}embraced the contradiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.27,0:40:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你也可以  按你自己的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could, too, in your own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.66,0:41:00.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如你可以走  但同时不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, maybe you could go and... not go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.79,0:41:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我听起来像个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I sound like a crazy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.51,0:41:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.10,0:41:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我就是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.68,0:41:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I can help...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.85,0:41:11.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你允许的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.62,0:41:16.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要在乎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.47,0:41:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这让我感觉很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it makes me feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.52,0:41:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你的东西都装好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get your stuff together,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.72,0:41:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找个我信任的人和你在门口碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}find somebody I trust to meet you at the gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.49,0:41:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你可以走  也同时不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can go and-- and not go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.10,0:41:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们看看  我是不是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see if I'm on to something
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.17,0:41:36.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说我又在胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if it's just more bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.48,0:41:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定这是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure this is what you want, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.39,0:42:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.20,0:42:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.47,0:42:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都应该由你自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have always been up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.47,0:42:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.61,0:42:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.82,0:42:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.46,0:42:42.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.50,0:42:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.57,0:42:47.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.97,0:42:51.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}?How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.44,0:42:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再多十分钟  我可能就要开始后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 more minutes, and I might start to regret
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.27,0:42:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前老想射你捅你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the times I tried to shoot and stab you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.57,0:43:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你是我敲倒的人里我最喜欢的一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're my favorite person I ever knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定能排到前二或前三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely top two or three.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.46,0:43:13.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.51,0:43:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我会的  -保证吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - Do you promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.98,0:43:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时刻警惕  时刻准备好  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always watching, always ready, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.20,0:43:23.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.08,0:43:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.33,0:43:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.77,0:44:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.09,0:45:18.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的应该尝一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really got to try one of these.